{"server":"en","storyId":"main_13_level_main_13-02_beg","groupId":"main_13","stageId":"main_13-02","title":"Not a Moment's Rest","storyCode":"13-3","avgTag":"Before Operation","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/en/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_13-02_beg.txt","sourceHash":"6a4052dae05e2fd9af3c8e1238ea3a6dcf402724ecf78829693b78d205c41c2c","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"34_g11_hispdwarshipdeck"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"???","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"What are you gazing at so absent-mindedly, Delphine?"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Delphine","speakerId":"avg_npc_866_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Nothing, Mother."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Delphine","speakerId":"avg_npc_866_1","isRemote":false,"text":"It's just..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Delphine","speakerId":"avg_npc_866_1","isRemote":false,"text":"I don't get to see Londinium from this angle very often."},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Duke of Windermere","speakerId":"avg_npc_868_1","isRemote":false,"text":"I know how you look when your mind is wandering."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Duke of Windermere","speakerId":"avg_npc_868_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Are you bored by the chatters from the rear?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Delphine","speakerId":"avg_npc_866_1","isRemote":false,"text":"No... I'm just thinking about Norport Borough."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Duke of Windermere","speakerId":"avg_npc_868_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Sorry, I didn't expect the situation in Londinium to deteriorate so much, so quickly."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Duke of Windermere","speakerId":"avg_npc_868_1","isRemote":false,"text":"I should have arranged for your evacuation sooner."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Delphine","speakerId":"avg_npc_866_1","isRemote":false,"text":"We had compiled reports on everything that went on in Londinium, but we weren't able to bring them."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Delphine","speakerId":"avg_npc_866_1","isRemote":false,"text":"We should be the ones apologizing."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Duke of Windermere","speakerId":"avg_npc_868_1","isRemote":false,"text":"That's alright. A few little troubles don't mean much to the big picture."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Delphine","speakerId":"avg_npc_866_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Perhaps the Duke of Caster should be held responsible for most of them."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Duke of Windermere","speakerId":"avg_npc_868_1","isRemote":false,"text":"I know. Let's hope my Messenger isn't making things too difficult for her right now."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Delphine","speakerId":"avg_npc_866_1","isRemote":false,"text":"But the value of that intel to subsequent operations..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Duke of Windermere","speakerId":"avg_npc_868_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Pales in comparison to your value, Delphine. Relax."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Duke of Windermere","speakerId":"avg_npc_868_1","isRemote":false,"text":"I'm here, and Irnclad Galavae is nearby. Everything will be right again once we return to the city."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Duke of Windermere","speakerId":"avg_npc_868_1","isRemote":false,"text":"We'll restore Londinium, and Victoria."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Delphine","speakerId":"avg_npc_866_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Of course."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Delphine","speakerId":"avg_npc_866_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Mother, I..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Delphine","speakerId":"avg_npc_866_1","isRemote":false,"text":"I thought I would die down there."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Duke of Windermere","speakerId":"avg_npc_868_1","isRemote":false,"text":"I wouldn't let that happen to my daughter."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Duke of Windermere","speakerId":"avg_npc_868_1","isRemote":false,"text":"You've done well. You have the patience and attention to detail of your father."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Duke of Windermere","speakerId":"avg_npc_868_1","isRemote":false,"text":"But you don't have to be the one to do all that work. You're my heir, and your place is at Lynncardine."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Duke of Windermere","speakerId":"avg_npc_868_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Our standoff with Leithanien can be trying. You'll need to get used to those matters. Plus... I could use someone to talk to."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Delphine","speakerId":"avg_npc_866_1","isRemote":false,"text":"I thought I could do better."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Delphine","speakerId":"avg_npc_866_1","isRemote":false,"text":"...Sorry."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Duke of Windermere","speakerId":"avg_npc_868_1","isRemote":false,"text":"There are many things that a Duke of Windermere must worry about, for which she needs nerves of steel."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Duke of Windermere","speakerId":"avg_npc_868_1","isRemote":false,"text":"But that's not your burden. Not yet."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Duke of Windermere","speakerId":"avg_npc_868_1","isRemote":false,"text":"You can rely on your mother, at least until she's too old to walk."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Delphine","speakerId":"avg_npc_866_1","isRemote":false,"text":"I understand... thank you, mother."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Duke of Windermere","speakerId":"avg_npc_868_1","isRemote":false,"text":"We'll be home in another four or five hours. I've arranged for all the stuff you left behind at the old house to be set up."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Duke of Windermere","speakerId":"avg_npc_868_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Your pajamas, your pillow, your bed, your bathtub."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Delphine","speakerId":"avg_npc_866_1","isRemote":false,"text":"That's all stuff from before I came to Londinium—"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Duke of Windermere","speakerId":"avg_npc_868_1","isRemote":false,"text":"It's not like you're any taller."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Duke of Windermere","speakerId":"avg_npc_868_1","isRemote":false,"text":"I have some nice things for you as well, but I'll keep those a secret for now."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Duke of Windermere","speakerId":"avg_npc_868_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Get a good night's sleep once we're back."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Duke of Windermere","speakerId":"avg_npc_868_1","isRemote":false,"text":"But don't get complacent. We have a lot to do."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Delphine","speakerId":"avg_npc_866_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Duke of Windermere","speakerId":"avg_npc_868_1","isRemote":false,"text":"What is it?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Delphine","speakerId":"avg_npc_866_1","isRemote":false,"text":"I was in Londinium a long time, wasn't I?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Delphine","speakerId":"avg_npc_866_1","isRemote":false,"text":"I had many friends. Outstanding friends, from whom I had a lot to learn."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Delphine","speakerId":"avg_npc_866_1","isRemote":false,"text":"We lived in a city in disorder, chewing up and swallowing the lives we once had. But we believed in our cause. I was proud of it."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Delphine","speakerId":"avg_npc_866_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Then... things changed. One agent after another disappeared, and the Sarkaz took the city..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Delphine","speakerId":"avg_npc_866_1","isRemote":false,"text":"I was on my own. I had to live with more... common people. For the first time, I learned how they lived, and how they viewed Victoria."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Delphine","speakerId":"avg_npc_866_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Most of them are dead now. Those who still live huddle in the bowels of this ship, waiting for you to decide their fate."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Delphine","speakerId":"avg_npc_866_1","isRemote":false,"text":"One hundred meters beneath my pajamas, bed, and bathtub."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Duke of Windermere","speakerId":"avg_npc_868_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Hmm."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Delphine","speakerId":"avg_npc_866_1","isRemote":false,"text":"I'm really grateful, really, but is it all because—"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Duke of Windermere","speakerId":"avg_npc_868_1","isRemote":false,"text":"You did well, my daughter. You exceeded my expectations."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Duke of Windermere","speakerId":"avg_npc_868_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Go and see the troops below. It'll do you good to talk with them."},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Delphine","speakerId":"avg_npc_866_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Mother!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Duke of Windermere","speakerId":"avg_npc_868_1","isRemote":false,"text":"We can talk later."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Delphine","speakerId":"avg_npc_866_1","isRemote":false,"text":"You shouldn't have come here yourself!"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Delphine","speakerId":"avg_npc_866_1","isRemote":false,"text":"It's too... risky!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Delphine","speakerId":"avg_npc_866_1","isRemote":false,"text":"We can't fully trust the Leithanians, and we don't know what the Sarkaz are planning next!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Delphine","speakerId":"avg_npc_866_1","isRemote":false,"text":"We've fallen behind on intel—"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_warehouse"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Siege","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":false,"text":"How long will our food last?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Siege","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":false,"text":"I don't think this warship was prepared to take on so many refugees."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Indra","speakerId":"avg_155_tiger_1","isRemote":false,"text":"We can't just leave 'em to fend for themselves!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Indra","speakerId":"avg_155_tiger_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Mrs. Emil grabbed my hand just now. She didn't say nuffin'. All she did was look at me..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Indra","speakerId":"avg_155_tiger_1","isRemote":false,"text":"I... I can't take it anymore. Let's find Delphine!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Dagda","speakerId":"avg_npc_396_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Calm down, Hannah. We're on someone else's ship."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Indra","speakerId":"avg_155_tiger_1","isRemote":false,"text":"I just—"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Morgan","speakerId":"avg_npc_405_1","isRemote":false,"text":"I'll go keep 'em company. The old timers will feel better with a familiar face around."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Siege","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":false,"text":"I'll stay with you."},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Delphine","speakerId":"avg_npc_866_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Sorry to keep you waiting. I talked to the quartermaster."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Delphine","speakerId":"avg_npc_866_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Some food will make it to those who need it most... that's the best I can do."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Siege","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Thank you, Delphine, and thanks to Duke Windermere."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Delphine","speakerId":"avg_npc_866_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Part of me hopes that Mother really wants to help these poor people out of the kindness of her heart, but..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Siege","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":false,"text":"I know. It's because of me, or should I say, because of who I am."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Siege","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":false,"text":"It's fine, as long as it helps the people who fled with us."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Delphine","speakerId":"avg_npc_866_1","isRemote":false,"text":"You've adapted quickly, Vina."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Siege","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":false,"text":"The time when we could do as we pleased has passed, Delphine."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Siege","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Many souls on this ship are counting on me. I have a responsibility to them, both as Vina and as the Siege."},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Siege","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":false,"text":"How goes the war?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Delphine","speakerId":"avg_npc_866_1","isRemote":false,"text":"The number of reports coming in is unreal. Too many variables to keep track of."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Delphine","speakerId":"avg_npc_866_1","isRemote":false,"text":"The Duke of Wellington's offensive is unsteady, and our own defensive lines are being pressed..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Delphine","speakerId":"avg_npc_866_1","isRemote":false,"text":"We should have an overwhelming advantage in terms of forces, even if the dukes have yet to commit their full strength. We are facing a foe beyond the scope of modern military theory."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Delphine","speakerId":"avg_npc_866_1","isRemote":false,"text":"The Nachzehrer King... the only thing we know about him comes from sparse records of ancient times."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Delphine","speakerId":"avg_npc_866_1","isRemote":false,"text":"It has been too long since Victoria, indeed Terra as a whole, last faced a real Sarkaz army."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Delphine","speakerId":"avg_npc_866_1","isRemote":false,"text":"What chain reaction will their witchcraft produce? Are they really as primitive and backwards as the records say?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Delphine","speakerId":"avg_npc_866_1","isRemote":false,"text":"What force have the various Sarkaz branches come together to form, where we can't see them? Why do they stand together?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Siege","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Delphine","speakerId":"avg_npc_866_1","isRemote":false,"text":"No need to worry too much, though. Mother... Duke Windermere and Duke Wellington will conduct this war together."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Delphine","speakerId":"avg_npc_866_1","isRemote":false,"text":"The Duke of Caster has also publicly declared her allegiance. The stalemate will not last long."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Delphine","speakerId":"avg_npc_866_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Once we return to Irnclad Galavae, both supplies and support will—"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Morgan","speakerId":"avg_npc_405_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Whoa! What was that?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Delphine","speakerId":"avg_npc_866_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Looks like we're passing through a canyon... a good thing. It means we're about to leave the battlefield."},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Dagda","speakerId":"avg_npc_396_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Is the ship slowing down, Siege?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Siege","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":false,"text":"I think so. And the weather outside... say, what time is it?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Siege","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":false,"text":"How long has it been since we left Norport?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Delphine","speakerId":"avg_npc_866_1","isRemote":false,"text":"A few hours, I think."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Siege","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Is this just an ordinary canyon?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Delphine","speakerId":"avg_npc_866_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Yes, nothing remarkable besides some abandoned factories..."},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Indra","speakerId":"avg_155_tiger_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Be careful!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Victorian Officer","speakerId":"avg_npc_408_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Indra","speakerId":"avg_155_tiger_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Hey, I'm talking to you!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Victorian Officer","speakerId":"avg_npc_408_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Delphine","speakerId":"avg_npc_866_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Get away from him, Hannah!"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Delphine","speakerId":"avg_npc_866_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Look out!"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Siege","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Look out!"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Delphine","speakerId":"avg_npc_866_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Blood mist? Sarkaz witchcraft!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Siege","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Too many civilians here."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Siege","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Morgan, Dagda, Indra."},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Delphine","speakerId":"avg_npc_866_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Go down! The stairs are to the north!"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Shearer","speakerId":"avg_npc_1070_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Lady Delphine!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Delphine","speakerId":"avg_npc_866_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Are you the ship's doctor?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Shearer","speakerId":"avg_npc_1070_1","isRemote":false,"text":"We're under attack by witchcraft. The ship's casters can't decipher it yet. The Duke and—"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Shearer","speakerId":"avg_npc_1070_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Damn, how did they—"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Dagda","speakerId":"avg_npc_396_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Look out!"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Confessarius Guard","speakerId":"avg_npc_425_1","isRemote":false,"text":"(In Sarkaz) The Vampire's witchcraft has taken hold."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Dagda","speakerId":"avg_npc_396_1","isRemote":false,"text":"I know that outfit... the skull mask..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Confessarius Guard","speakerId":"avg_npc_425_1","isRemote":false,"text":"(In Sarkaz) The Sighs of Kings... one variable to eliminate."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Confessarius Guard","speakerId":"avg_npc_425_1","isRemote":false,"text":"(In Sarkaz) Cause chaos and eliminate the outblood. Hesitate not to spill your own blood."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Confessarius Guard","speakerId":"avg_npc_425_1","isRemote":false,"text":"(In Sarkaz) Oh?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Dagda","speakerId":"avg_npc_396_1","isRemote":false,"text":"You were part of the siege of the Knights of the Tower..."},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Indra","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"Careful! I've gotcha!"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Confessarius Guard","speakerId":"avg_npc_425_1","isRemote":false,"text":"(In Sarkaz) You will die here with your king, Victorian."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Confessarius Guard","speakerId":"avg_npc_425_1","isRemote":false,"text":"(In Sarkaz) Do it."},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Delphine","speakerId":"avg_npc_866_1","isRemote":false,"text":"(Mother is on deck, but we still have civilians and our people below... I...)"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Morgan","speakerId":"avg_npc_405_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Delphine! Your left!"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Delphine","speakerId":"avg_npc_866_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Ugh!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Morgan","speakerId":"avg_npc_405_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Careful."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Delphine","speakerId":"avg_npc_866_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Sorry, thanks."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Delphine","speakerId":"avg_npc_866_1","isRemote":false,"text":"There aren't many of them. We can pin them down. The reinforced compartment is one bulkhead away. Get the civilians there—"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Siege","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":false,"text":"No, there's something more important that you must do."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Siege","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Those people came with me. I promised to protect them."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Siege","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Duke Windermere likely doesn't know how bad things are below."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Siege","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Go and inform her. I'll hold out until your reinforcements arrive."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Delphine","speakerId":"avg_npc_866_1","isRemote":false,"text":"But I—"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Siege","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":false,"text":"This suits us better. You have a formal command structure. There's no way to integrate us quickly."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Delphine","speakerId":"avg_npc_866_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Vina..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Siege","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Go!"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Siege","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Damn, you've got a hard head. Almost made my hand go numb."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Confessarius Guard","speakerId":"avg_npc_425_1","isRemote":false,"text":"*Sarkaz profanity*..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Confessarius Guard","speakerId":"avg_npc_425_1","isRemote":false,"text":"(In Sarkaz) So be it. The Sighs of Kings will be spoils enough."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Confessarius Guard","speakerId":"avg_npc_425_1","isRemote":false,"text":"(In Sarkaz) Surround the Aslan."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Siege","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Get ready for a brawl, mates."},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Siege","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":false,"text":"This ends now."},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"???","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"Delphine!"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"???","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"Delphine!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Delphine","speakerId":"avg_npc_866_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Mother?"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Victorian Officer","speakerId":"avg_npc_1073_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Delphine... go no further..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Delphine","speakerId":"avg_npc_866_1","isRemote":false,"text":"You're hurt—"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Victorian Officer","speakerId":"avg_npc_1073_1","isRemote":false,"text":"You'll only be in the way. Same for me."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Victorian Officer","speakerId":"avg_npc_1073_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Kill me, before whatever this is consumes me."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Victorian Officer","speakerId":"avg_npc_1073_1","isRemote":false,"text":"The Swordguards and Her Grace will kill the Sarkaz."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Victorian Officer","speakerId":"avg_npc_1073_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Do not put yourself in danger, Delphine... no..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Victorian Officer","speakerId":"avg_npc_1073_1","isRemote":false,"text":"I don't even feel the pain anymore..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Victorian Officer","speakerId":"avg_npc_1073_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Free me. Then stop."},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Victorian Officer","speakerId":"avg_npc_1073_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Lady Delphine—You must live—"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Victorian Officer","speakerId":"avg_npc_1073_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Thank you—for freeing me—"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Delphine","speakerId":"avg_npc_866_1","isRemote":false,"text":"This is... Sarkaz..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Delphine","speakerId":"avg_npc_866_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Mother..."},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"43_g13_hispdwarshipdeck_ex"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Sanguinarch of Vampires","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Hmm."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Sanguinarch of Vampires","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"You should not have dodged."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Sanguinarch of Vampires","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"The paleness of your face would have contrasted well with the blood drops."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Sanguinarch of Vampires","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"They would have painted a picture of beautiful despair."},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Duke of Windermere","speakerId":"avg_npc_868_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Hmph."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Duke of Windermere","speakerId":"avg_npc_868_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Leeches can't stop playing with blood, I see."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Duke of Windermere","speakerId":"avg_npc_868_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Nothing has changed with you people, even after all these centuries."},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Sanguinarch of Vampires","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Look."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Sanguinarch of Vampires","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"It's a good day to die."},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Swordguard","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"Your Grace, this attack was planned."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Duke of Windermere","speakerId":"avg_npc_868_1","isRemote":false,"text":"As expected."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Duke of Windermere","speakerId":"avg_npc_868_1","isRemote":false,"text":"For a sovereign of the Sarkaz to pay a personal visit, though... all well and good, I suppose."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Swordguard","speakerId":"avg_npc_1073_1","isRemote":false,"text":"The battle below is not going well. The officers are organizing the defense."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Duke of Windermere","speakerId":"avg_npc_868_1","isRemote":false,"text":"No matter. This one is our only threat."},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Duke of Windermere","speakerId":"avg_npc_868_1","isRemote":false,"text":"I've long had enough of Leithanian Spire Arts."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Duke of Windermere","speakerId":"avg_npc_868_1","isRemote":false,"text":"I wonder what the spine of a Vampire looks like."},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Sanguinarch of Vampires","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Hmmm."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Sanguinarch of Vampires","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"You're a strong Victorian. You don't think you'll shirk back."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Sanguinarch of Vampires","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"But your blood will betray you."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Sanguinarch of Vampires","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"The creator built a bridge of life for humanity, and I stand above the bridge."},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Sanguinarch of Vampires","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Oh?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Duke of Windermere","speakerId":"avg_npc_868_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Not any worse than those spire madmen."},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Sanguinarch of Vampires","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Poor fool."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Sanguinarch of Vampires","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Still clinging to dreams and fantasies."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Sanguinarch of Vampires","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Guess why your battleship fell from within?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Duke of Windermere","speakerId":"avg_npc_868_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Duke of Windermere","speakerId":"avg_npc_868_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Focus on the mission at hand, soldiers."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Duke of Windermere","speakerId":"avg_npc_868_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Ready."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Swordguard","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"Roger."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Duke of Windermere","speakerId":"avg_npc_868_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Your duty is to kill the enemies of Windermere, not protect the life of Windermere."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Duke of Windermere","speakerId":"avg_npc_868_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Do all you can to weaken the Sarkaz. Victoria will take back what is hers."},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Sanguinarch of Vampires","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Hm."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Sanguinarch of Vampires","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Not bad, not bad... you aren't a duke of Victoria for nothing."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Sanguinarch of Vampires","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"How many Sarkaz have you eaten?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Duke of Windermere","speakerId":"avg_npc_868_1","isRemote":false,"text":"I don't have any such disgusting habits."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Sanguinarch of Vampires","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"No."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Sanguinarch of Vampires","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"You and your ancestors reveled in war, from Kazimierz to Leithanien."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Sanguinarch of Vampires","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"A Duke of Windermere once had an army of Sarkaz. In the War of the Four Nations, which engulfed most of the land..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Sanguinarch of Vampires","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"How did you or your ancestor use them?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Duke of Windermere","speakerId":"avg_npc_868_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Sanguinarch of Vampires","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Parlor tricks, the theft of witchcraft, a favorite of the Nachzehrer."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Sanguinarch of Vampires","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"The blood and flesh of Sarkaz spread across the battlefield, becoming yet another bulwark for your glorious armada."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Sanguinarch of Vampires","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"You ate them up, alright."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Duke of Windermere","speakerId":"avg_npc_868_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Are you after revenge, Sarkaz?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Sanguinarch of Vampires","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Of course."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Sanguinarch of Vampires","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"How dare you trifle with the methods of my creation, the property of the Crimson Court?"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Swordguard","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"He's being strengthened by the blood of the fallen?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Duke of Windermere","speakerId":"avg_npc_868_1","isRemote":false,"text":"No."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Duke of Windermere","speakerId":"avg_npc_868_1","isRemote":false,"text":"It is no longer bodily fluids, but a part of the curse."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Duke of Windermere","speakerId":"avg_npc_868_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Prepare counter-Arts."},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Delphine","speakerId":"avg_npc_866_1","isRemote":false,"text":"I..."},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_warehouse"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"43_g13_hispdwarshipdeck_ex"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Delphine","speakerId":"avg_npc_866_1","isRemote":false,"text":"—!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Delphine","speakerId":"avg_npc_866_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Could it be...? No, Arts that can teleport an entire army are unheard of... our ship fell from within..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Delphine","speakerId":"avg_npc_866_1","isRemote":false,"text":"I know this feeling..."},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Delphine","speakerId":"avg_npc_866_1","isRemote":false,"text":"But what about the Vampire? Why didn't he go straight to his target, if he could use his witchcraft on the officers?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Delphine","speakerId":"avg_npc_866_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Attacking secondary targets with witchcraft, then creating disorder with assassins... that's too inefficient."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Delphine","speakerId":"avg_npc_866_1","isRemote":false,"text":"But the Sarkaz fighting with Mother..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Delphine","speakerId":"avg_npc_866_1","isRemote":false,"text":"The Damazti... did he simply infiltrate us by taking the face of a Victorian?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Delphine","speakerId":"avg_npc_866_1","isRemote":false,"text":"If..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Delphine","speakerId":"avg_npc_866_1","isRemote":false,"text":"—Damn it!"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Delphine","speakerId":"avg_npc_866_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Mother!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Duke of Windermere","speakerId":"avg_npc_868_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Delphine?! Stay back—"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Delphine","speakerId":"avg_npc_866_1","isRemote":false,"text":"That one's fake!"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Sanguinarch of Vampires","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Enough."},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Sanguinarch of Vampires","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"I don't enjoy seeing another wear my face."},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Sanguinarch of Vampires","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"A little girl saw through your disguise."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Sanguinarch of Vampires","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"You're losing your touch, Damazti. The previous you would have been more convincing."},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Damazti Cluster","speakerId":"avg_npc_426_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Damazti Cluster","speakerId":"avg_npc_426_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Is that so?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Sanguinarch of Vampires","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"These Arts are merely a poor imitation by the Confessarius."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Sanguinarch of Vampires","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Foul, uncouth, vulgar killing."},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Duke of Windermere","speakerId":"avg_npc_868_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Delphine."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Delphine","speakerId":"avg_npc_866_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Y-Yes!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Duke of Windermere","speakerId":"avg_npc_868_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Good job seeing through the trick. All the Swordguards would have been lost."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Duke of Windermere","speakerId":"avg_npc_868_1","isRemote":false,"text":"But there's nothing more you can do here now."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Delphine","speakerId":"avg_npc_866_1","isRemote":false,"text":"I, I—"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Duke of Windermere","speakerId":"avg_npc_868_1","isRemote":false,"text":"The escort fleet is approaching. We must ensure that communication with the fleet is maintained."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Delphine","speakerId":"avg_npc_866_1","isRemote":false,"text":"The communications tower... it's behind the deck!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Duke of Windermere","speakerId":"avg_npc_868_1","isRemote":false,"text":"The enemy is few in number. Go."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Duke of Windermere","speakerId":"avg_npc_868_1","isRemote":false,"text":"...I'm counting on you."},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Delphine","speakerId":"avg_npc_866_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Understood."},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Delphine","speakerId":"avg_npc_866_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Thank goodness, the communications tower hasn't fallen yet—"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Delphine","speakerId":"avg_npc_866_1","isRemote":false,"text":"The ship's slowing down?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Delphine","speakerId":"avg_npc_866_1","isRemote":false,"text":"It's the engines! They're attacking the engine room!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Delphine","speakerId":"avg_npc_866_1","isRemote":false,"text":"—!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Victorian Soldier","speakerId":"avg_npc_248","isRemote":false,"text":"D-Damn it!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Delphine","speakerId":"avg_npc_866_1","isRemote":false,"text":"—"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Delphine","speakerId":"avg_npc_866_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Grab my hand!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Delphine","speakerId":"avg_npc_866_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Don't look back! Get up!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Victorian Soldier","speakerId":"avg_npc_248","isRemote":false,"text":"Thank you! Oh, L-Lady Delphine—"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Delphine","speakerId":"avg_npc_866_1","isRemote":false,"text":"We must regroup and counterattack. Reinforcements are on the way."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Delphine","speakerId":"avg_npc_866_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Listen up, men!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Delphine","speakerId":"avg_npc_866_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Dust clouds in the distance! Help is on the way!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Delphine","speakerId":"avg_npc_866_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Their plan—"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Siege","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Delphine! Look out!"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Delphine","speakerId":"avg_npc_866_1","isRemote":false,"text":"*Pant*... *pant*..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Siege","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Are you alright?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Delphine","speakerId":"avg_npc_866_1","isRemote":false,"text":"I'm fine... it's all in my head..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Siege","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Your troops are holding back the enemy down below, so we've come up to help."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Siege","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":false,"text":"The bad news is that we found traces of the Damazti down there."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Delphine","speakerId":"avg_npc_866_1","isRemote":false,"text":"We know. The Sanguinarch and Damazti are attacking together."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Delphine","speakerId":"avg_npc_866_1","isRemote":false,"text":"No, wait..."},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Siege","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Delphine? Where are you going?"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Siege","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Agh, dreadful!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Confessarius Guard","speakerId":"avg_npc_425_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Confessarius Guard","speakerId":"avg_npc_425_1","isRemote":false,"text":"(In Sarkaz) The scent of blood has changed. The Confessarius has succeeded, as has the Sanguinarch."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Confessarius Guard","speakerId":"avg_npc_425_1","isRemote":false,"text":"(In Sarkaz) Pull back."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Confessarius Guard","speakerId":"avg_npc_425_1","isRemote":false,"text":"(In Sarkaz) Those unable to do so, drive your daggers into your hearts on my command."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Siege","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":false,"text":"You—"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Duke of Windermere","speakerId":"avg_npc_868_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Ugh..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Damazti Cluster","speakerId":"avg_npc_426_1","isRemote":false,"text":"You have lost all sensation in your arms. Your guards are routed."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Damazti Cluster","speakerId":"avg_npc_426_1","isRemote":false,"text":"How do you feel now?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Damazti Cluster","speakerId":"avg_npc_426_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Duke of Windermere","speakerId":"avg_npc_868_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Argh... ugh..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Duke of Windermere","speakerId":"avg_npc_868_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Sarkaz..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Damazti Cluster","speakerId":"avg_npc_426_1","isRemote":false,"text":"He caught you."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Damazti Cluster","speakerId":"avg_npc_426_1","isRemote":false,"text":"An instant of weakness, of disorder... why? We do not understand."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Damazti Cluster","speakerId":"avg_npc_426_1","isRemote":false,"text":"We find it... regrettable."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Duke of Windermere","speakerId":"avg_npc_868_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Sanguinarch of Vampires","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Sanguinarch of Vampires","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"She's finished. Let this great warrior savor the fading of life."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Damazti Cluster","speakerId":"avg_npc_426_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Are you leaving?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Sanguinarch of Vampires","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"I have no interest in the inconsequential deaths that remain."},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Sanguinarch of Vampires","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"This blood is a penny a gallon."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Damazti Cluster","speakerId":"avg_npc_426_1","isRemote":false,"text":"What are you after? We are unsure."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Sanguinarch of Vampires","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Sanguinarch of Vampires","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"The age of shame is coming to an end."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Damazti Cluster","speakerId":"avg_npc_426_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Are you hurt?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Sanguinarch of Vampires","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"...It does not matter."},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Delphine","speakerId":"avg_npc_866_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Y... You..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Damazti Cluster","speakerId":"avg_npc_426_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Oh, there you are."},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Damazti Cluster","speakerId":"avg_npc_868_1","isRemote":false,"text":"The one who saw through us."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Damazti Cluster","speakerId":"avg_npc_868_1","isRemote":false,"text":"He said we were losing our touch. How convincing was the last one?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Damazti Cluster","speakerId":"avg_npc_868_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Is this good enough?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Delphine","speakerId":"avg_npc_866_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Don't—you dare—wear her—face—"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Damazti Cluster","speakerId":"avg_npc_868_1","isRemote":false,"text":"...We must try."},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Delphine","speakerId":"avg_npc_866_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Sarkaz!"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Damazti Cluster","speakerId":"avg_npc_866_1","isRemote":false,"text":"(In Sarkaz) We'll do better next time."},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Delphine","speakerId":"avg_npc_866_1","isRemote":false,"text":"—"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Duke of Windermere","speakerId":"avg_npc_868_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Delphine..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Duke of Windermere","speakerId":"avg_npc_868_1","isRemote":false,"text":"I can't see very well..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Duke of Windermere","speakerId":"avg_npc_868_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Have they retreated?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Delphine","speakerId":"avg_npc_866_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Mo...ther..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Delphine","speakerId":"avg_npc_866_1","isRemote":false,"text":"They're gone..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Delphine","speakerId":"avg_npc_866_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Mother... I, I'll call for the doctors—"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Delphine","speakerId":"avg_npc_866_1","isRemote":false,"text":"You'll be fine. You're the Duke of Windermere. You're my mother."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Delphine","speakerId":"avg_npc_866_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Wait here, I'll—"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Duke of Windermere","speakerId":"avg_npc_868_1","isRemote":false,"text":"I couldn't beat him... I can't believe it..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Duke of Windermere","speakerId":"avg_npc_868_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Don't go, Delphine... don't go..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Duke of Windermere","speakerId":"avg_npc_868_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Let me... look at you..."},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Duke of Windermere","speakerId":"avg_npc_868_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Don't cry."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Delphine","speakerId":"avg_npc_866_1","isRemote":false,"text":"I... I'm not crying, Mother."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Duke of Windermere","speakerId":"avg_npc_868_1","isRemote":false,"text":"I saw you swing your sword, Delphine... very good."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Duke of Windermere","speakerId":"avg_npc_868_1","isRemote":false,"text":"You had injured your hand. Your grip... it was never right. I was too hasty."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Delphine","speakerId":"avg_npc_866_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Mother... don't say any more..."},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Duke of Windermere","speakerId":"avg_npc_868_1","isRemote":false,"text":"I remember... the direction your father left in..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Duke of Windermere","speakerId":"avg_npc_868_1","isRemote":false,"text":"We had a surprise for you... one that we prepared long ago..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Delphine","speakerId":"avg_npc_866_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Mother..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Duke of Windermere","speakerId":"avg_npc_868_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Delphine, you—"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Duke of Windermere","speakerId":"avg_npc_868_1","isRemote":false,"text":"I thought you would be taller... the clothes will be a bit loose..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Duke of Windermere","speakerId":"avg_npc_868_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Just... calm down, Delphine..."},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[]}
